            <Text><![CDATA[[ [ XIC(DG_7404_001_HiHiAlm) XIC(DG_7404_002_HiHiAlm) ] , [ XIC(DG_7404_001_HiHiAlm) XIC(DG_7404_003_HiHiAlm) ] , [ XIC(DG_7404_002_HiHiAlm) XIC(DG_7404_003_HiHiAlm) ] ] OTE(VOTE_Zone1_Gas_Confirmed);]]></Text>
          </Rung>
          <Rung Number="1" Type="N">
            <Comment><![CDATA[Zone 2 (Pump House) 2ooN Gas Voting (DG-004 .. 006)]]></Comment>
